 a brilliant but young girl named Nobuna Oda. Yoshiharu starts working under her command, who nicknames him Saru (monkey), to bring back history to its correct course and find his way back home to the present world.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":6.3}],"value":6.3,"age":"pg-13"},"current_season_id":9403,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}